{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“上一段”准确承接此前已经发生的心理变化，没有新增前史或外部事件；“把决定做下去”表达的是抽象的决断与行动意愿，并非把珠子里的脚步比喻写成真实动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"内容围绕努力与结果之间的边界展开，没有添加具体情节，也没有把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“那种生活”承接前文已经说明的向往，“把它算进承担里”表达心理选择，没有虚构具体的人物关系或生活场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"他发虚的原因明确是想到代价，而不是音乐变化；“向前”“撤回”都是抽象的决断表达，没有写成真实的脚步动作。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-6说明他已经能在害怕时行动，能够支撑这次继续决断，但不再等待毫无损失的办法这一变化，更直接的前因是S11-5所写的继续等待也无法消除妨碍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-2说明承担责任能推动他行动，却不能替他实现珍惜的生活，直接限制了他对行动效果的期待。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-2给出了他真正珍惜的生活及其价值，能够解释为什么他现在愿意把这份向往纳入责任。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S11-4已经写出他既不愿再逼自己硬撑、也不愿看珍惜的生活继续受损，S12-3正是把这两难转化为带着牵挂行动。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能读出完整的递进：他已经能在害怕时行动，继而放下对结果的过高要求，把珍惜的生活纳入责任，最后带着不安继续做事。 \",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R60\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“久违的昂扬回来”这一明确的主观感受没有保留下来；“终于肯把决定做下去”写出了决断与行动，却没有表达那份重新涌现的昂扬振奋。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S12-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"开头“上一段他已经在害怕时接过眼前的事”几乎复述S11-6已有内容，再用分号转入当前决定，跨段前因可以由箭头承担，略显回述。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S12-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“仍愿意尽力”与“做了能做的”重复表达愿意行动，“不再要求每次努力都得扭转局面”与“结果仍由不得他保证”也有明显重叠，可以压缩。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "001a9174-db9c-488e-98cc-cb9a61277dd1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T064734611839Z", "elapsed_seconds": 333.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:53:08.061816+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3cba603390f1be1da21a4a9f5464e77b4bb59f95ea2ccb6896e0aec5bf5a92bf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T064734611839Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "10f91ea4c7e77698b9c449f9f36d19c79a68175d53d83ecd1d665e71a4de985f"}}}
